1) Too Good to Go

## Overview

The world's largest surplus food marketplace.

## Target audience

- Restaurants
- Bakeries
- Cafes
- Supermarkets

## Business model

- Fixed commission per sold box
- Annual partner fee

## Strengths

- Large user base
- Strong brand
- Simple UX

## Weaknesses

- Limited customization
- Surprise concept is not for everyone
- Customer support complaints

## Opportunities for Plately

- More transparent box information
- Better restaurant analytics
- Flexible pricing
- Better localization for Ukraine
